## Specific foods

### Green (generally fine, normal portion)
- Apples, berries, grapes, pineapple, citrus in small amounts, pears, peaches [Kidney Fund: eating plan] [NKFM]
- Cauliflower, cabbage, cucumber, green beans, peppers, onions, lettuce, carrots [Kidney Fund: eating plan] [NKFM] [kidney.org superfoods]
- White rice, white bread, pasta, tortillas, bagels, English muffins [NKFM] [Kidney Fund: eating plan]
- Unsalted popcorn, unsalted crackers, rice cakes [NKFM] [Rogosin]
- Olive oil, herbs and spices [Rogosin] [NIDDK]
- Coffee, tea, unflavored water, sugar-free soda [NKFM]

### Yellow (small portions or occasionally)
- Chicken, turkey, fish, shellfish, eggs (fish up to 5 meals a week, poultry up to 5 meals a week) [NKFM] [Rogosin] [kidney.org superfoods]
- Beans, lentils, chickpeas, tofu (check potassium and phosphorus if on a limit) [NKFM] [Kidney Fund: Kitchen]
- Whole-grain bread, brown rice [Kidney Fund: eating plan] [Kidney Fund: Kitchen]
- Low-fat milk or yogurt, or 1 oz of cheese a day [Rogosin]
- Plant milks like unenriched almond or rice milk; check labels for additives [NKFM] [kidney.org superfoods]
- Red meat (beef, pork, lamb): about once a week at most [Rogosin]

### Orange (eat little or swap)
- Bananas, oranges, grapefruit, melons, prunes, raisins [Kidney Fund: eating plan] [Rogosin]
- Potatoes, tomatoes, spinach, winter squash, avocado [Kidney Fund: eating plan] [Rogosin] [NIDDK]
- Nuts, seeds, oatmeal, bran cereal, granola [Kidney Fund: eating plan] [Kidney Fund: Kitchen]
- Brown or wild rice (higher potassium and phosphorus) [Kidney Fund: eating plan]
- Sweets, cakes, cookies, chocolate [Rogosin]
- Wine: up to 3 to 4 oz with a meal, if his doctor allows any alcohol [Rogosin] [NIDDK]

### Red (avoid or rarely)
- Processed and cured meats: bacon, sausage, ham, salami, deli meats [Rogosin] [NIDDK]
- Fried and fast food [Rogosin] [NIDDK]
- Canned or salted foods, chips, table salt, ketchup, soy sauce, barbecue sauce, teriyaki [NIDDK] [Kidney Fund: Kitchen]
- Salt substitutes with potassium chloride [NKFM] [Rogosin] [NIDDK]
- Coconut milk and coconut products [Rogosin]
- Dark colas and foods with phosphorus additives ("phos" on the label) [Kidney Fund: eating plan] [NKFM]
- Organ meats [Kidney Fund: Kitchen]
- Cherry pits (toxic, do not eat) [kidney.org superfoods]

